  "description": "IROKOT01 crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C135 H89 N1 O26 Y4,3(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Y1 (Y) has 8 O neighbors; Y2 (Y) has 8 O neighbors; Y3 (Y) has 8 O neighbors; Y4 (Y) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.710-3.819 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 101.84-109.72°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links.",
